set.add name="rels" id="reldef:responsible:broadcaster"
def "reldef:responsible:chairman" "chairman (進行役) — the target agent is responsible for progress in the source society; holds the two admin-delegated powers (admit casts, set responsibles) for that society. Generalises society:decider."
set.add name="rels" id="reldef:responsible:chairman"
